From e631e06cd405b8a598016bb049163fa717425c82 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: anyingiit <winshyon@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 18:14:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(config): parse ctrl-- and alt-- keybindings

parse_key split a binding on every dash, so a dash after a modifier
(ctrl--, alt--) produced three sections and was rejected with
"Shortcut can only have 2 keys". config.yml skipped the binding with a
warning, and Settings stored alt-- while the old binding stayed active.

Split on the first dash only. ctrl-a-b still fails in modifier_char,
which names the binding.

Closes #554
